                    <h3>What is Liability Insurance?</h3>
                    <p>
                        Liability Insurance is designed to help protect individuals or businesses against covered third-party claims. Depending on the selected policy, it may provide coverage for liabilities related to bodily injury, property damage, or other eligible claims.
                    </p>

