                        <li><i class="bi bi-check-circle"></i> <span>May provide coverage for specified bodily injury or property damage claims.</span></li>
                        <li><i class="bi bi-check-circle"></i> <span>Coverage options can be selected based on specific liability requirements.</span></li>
                    </ul>

                    <p>
                        Liability Insurance can help manage the financial impact of unexpected third-party claims. Coverage, exclusions, premiums, claim conditions, and applicable benefits depend on the selected policy and its terms.
                    </p>

                    <p>
